n-right: 40px;"><tbody><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 13px; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); text-align: justify; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">* Qantas Points will expire at midnight Sydney, Australia time at the end of the 18th consecutive month for which the Member has not earned Qantas Points or transferred Qantas Points from a Membership Account to a Qantas Frequent Flyer member's membership account. Qantas Points are deemed to be earned on the date of an Eligible Flight, or in the case of other Program Partners, on the activity date as advised by the Program Partner and appearing on the Member's statement.</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 13px; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); text-align: justify; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 13px; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); text-align: justify; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">+ Qantas Points are offered under the applicable partner's terms and conditions and earning thresholds may apply. Membership of Qantas Business Rewards and the earning of Qantas Points as a business are subject to the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/terms" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Qantas Business Rewards Terms and Conditions</a>&nbsp;.</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 13px; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); text-align: justify; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 13px; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); text-align: justify; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">^ You must be a Qantas Frequent Flyer member to earn and redeem Qantas Points. A joining fee may apply. Membership and Qantas Points are subject to the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/fflyer/dyn/program/terms" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Qantas Frequent Flyer program Terms and Conditions</a>. We recommend you consult your accountant or tax adviser to ensure you understand possible tax implications, for example fringe benefits tax (if applicable).</font></td></tr><tr></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 13px; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); text-align: justify; height: 13px;"></td></tr><tr></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 13px; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); text-align: justify; height: 13px;"></td></tr><tr></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 13px; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); text-align: justify; height: 13px;"></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 13px; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); text-align: justify; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 13px; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); text-align: justify; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br><br><br></font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>]]></td>
